@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR002: View Client Intervention Alerts" as FAFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Recommendations" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Recommendation Preferences" as CFR005
  usecase "SFR012: Generate Client Dashboards" as SFR012
  usecase "SFR013: Generate Client Alerts" as SFR013
  usecase "AIFR009: Generate Contextualized News Insights" as AIFR009

  client --> CFR001 : View financial data consolidated in a single dashboard.
  client --> FAFR002 : Receive alerts about potential fraud or unusual spending patterns.
  client --> CFR003 : Access future financial trends and make informed decisions.
  client --> CFR004 : Get tailored investment advice based on personal profiles.
  client --> CFR005 : Adjust preferences for recommendations to align with goals.
  client --> SFR012 : View a personalized dashboard integrating all financial information.
  client --> SAFR001 : Modify analysis parameters affecting system accuracy and compliance.

  sysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Configure AI settings ensuring regulatory standards like Basel III are met.
  
  advisor --> FAFR003 : Use predictive analytics to guide clients during consultations.
  advisor --> FAFR004 : Customize client-specific analysis parameters per their profiles or regulations (e.g., GDPR).
  advisor --> AIFR008 : Request interventions when needed based on system-generated insights.

  system --> CFR001 : Deliver financial data visualizations from the dashboard component.
  system --> SFR012 : Create and update client dashboards with new information.
  system --> SAFR001 : Control AI parameters for compliance checks (e.g., AML, FATF).
  
  aiSystem --> AIFR001: Analyze historical data to predict financial trends.
  aiSystem --> AIFR002: Generate personalized investment recommendations based on user profiles and goals.
  aiSystem --> AIFR003: Detect spending limit breaches using pattern recognition.
  aiSystem --> AIFR004: Identify suitable investments matching risk tolerance and ESG criteria.
  aiSystem --> AIFR005: Suggest financial instruments aligned with Modern Portfolio Theory principles.
  aiSystem --> AIFR006: Flag potential fraud by analyzing transactional patterns against regulatory standards (FinCEN).
  aiSystem --> AIFR007: Correlate news articles to client portfolios for relevance.
  aiSystem --> AIFR008: Recommend actions based on predictive analysis of financial behavior.
  
  client <|-- CFR001 : Client uses the system's capabilities through the dashboard feature.
  client <|-- FAFR002 : Client receives alerts via the system’s alerting mechanisms.
  client <|-- SFR013 : Client is notified about critical events based on pre-set conditions.

  sysAdmin <|-- SAFR001 : System Administrator manages and tunes AI parameters for compliance with financial regulations (e.g., Basel III, GDPR).

  advisor <|-- FAFR004 : Financial Advisor configures analysis settings specific to client segments.
  
}

@enduml